Classification: CONFIRMED
Reason: CROSS_RECORD_ATOMICITY_GAP (code-verified, not runtime-verified)
  The Like and notification are NOT in the same transaction. A failure
  between them leaves an inconsistent state (Like without notification).
  This is a real atomicity gap, not a theoretical risk.

